              "key": "start",
              "value": "Charlotte, NC"
            },
            {
              "key": "finish",
              "value": "Los Angeles, CA"
            }
          ]
        },
        "description": "With $50/hour driver + truck cost, the alternative fuel saving does not cover extra driving. Inspect route_selection.options and total_operating_cost."
      }
    },
